{"hw":"ἕωθεν","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἕωθεν</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἕωθεν</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἠῶθεν</span> (q.v.), <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, (<span class=\"gk\">ἕως</span> (A)) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">from morn</b>, i.e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">at earliest dawn</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">59d</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἕ. εὐθύς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1121</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eub.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">119.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">αὔριον ἕ</span>. to-morrow <b class=\"lex-tr\">early</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.6</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">La.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">201c</span> </span>; so <span class=\"gk\">ἕωθεν</span> alone, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">278</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τό γ' ἕωθεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">546a22</span> </span>.</div></div>"}